---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Blog | Intent & Proof"
	description="Growth guides on SEO, landing pages, paid acquisition and tracking for service businesses."
>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="section-head">
			<div>
				<h2>Intent &amp; Proof Blog</h2>
				<p>Guides, systems and practical notes for building better lead generation machines.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="card-grid">
			<article class="card">
				<div class="card-kicker">Local SEO</div>
				<h3>City pages for premium service businesses</h3>
				<p>A practical framework for turning location intent into qualified calls and WhatsApp leads.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="card">
				<div class="card-kicker">Google Ads</div>
				<h3>Search campaigns without budget cremation</h3>
				<p>Intent, landing message, call tracking and conversion quality. Apparently clicks alone do not pay rent.</p>
			</article>

			<article class="card">
				<div class="card-kicker">Analytics</div>
				<h3>The minimum tracking stack before launching ads</h3>
				<p>Events, consent, call actions, WhatsApp clicks and clean reporting before the budget starts leaking.</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
